ple: The vines were winding around the trees."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sandstone"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a soft yellow or red rock often used as a building material"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Use sandstone to cut out blocks for the building."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "valley"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area of low land between hills or mountains"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We went for a nice walk in the valley."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to rent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pay to live somewhere"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I pay a lot of rent to live in this house."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "amphitheater"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a steep, sloped circular open air theater"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I went to the amphitheater to watch the play."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "monastery"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place where some religious men live"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will tour the monastery and pray with the monks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "treasury"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building where money is 